{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "04a426a071d7bf4f2460c35e2e974bdc83a159a01ad3acb038749cd321ca2258", "ja": "Badコンディション！", "zh": "状态不佳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "249d538f6725ce4dd3491f0f1c37309d88f5a71f39853b460b4014710f7b1f29", "ja": "レッスンは順調……かに見えたが、亜利沙が\n体調を崩す。画像編集での寝不足が原因らし\nい。自分は大丈夫だと食い下がる亜利沙だっ\nたが、プロデューサーやメンバーが本気で心\n配していると知り、休む事に。", "zh": "训练本来进展顺利……看起来是这样，但亚利沙的\n身体却出了问题。似乎是图片编辑导致的睡眠不足。\n亚利沙坚持说自己没事，但得知制作人和成员们都在真\n心担心她后，决定休息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4d33c4926a916c7818c850d1f7b15a04f9833018b05e834c576d2f6128184eb0", "ja": "（野外イベントに向けてのレッスンは順調。\n楽器の演奏も、少しずつ上手になってきている……）", "zh": "（面向户外活动的课程进展顺利。\n乐器演奏也在一点一点地变得熟练……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1001_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "f679ff91819ec3e01c2e27654a6dabbe1e1bfd0800131066358e25f9d768e65b", "ja": "{$P$}！\n大変だべさ、亜利沙さんが……！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n不好了，亚利沙小姐她……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "5db3553fc727a3ed07d6f28169cb691034c19f1c96726ea64250887c5fbbbea9", "ja": "み、みんな大げさですよぉ。ありさ、\nちょっとふらついちゃっただけで……。", "zh": "大、大家太夸张啦。亚利沙\n只是稍微有点头晕而已……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "69d3c160a23050f4516f798dca5a70eb6ab136fe7d84684b4170ba0aae1c69df", "ja": "ほら、このとおり！　もう大丈夫ですから！", "zh": "你看，就像这样！已经没事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "41b7762f8bcdb29661987ebb5c59ce246b5e03020a3c0941fbd6ca9bbdaa531a", "ja": "急に体を動かしちゃダメだよ、亜利沙ちゃん！\nすこし休んでなきゃ。ね？", "zh": "不能突然剧烈活动啦，亚利沙！\n得好好休息一下才行。好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ec3a843422a1301aba33e6ba1694c788ceb30dd9d8d8206602e90c2d94b125b2", "ja": "亜利沙、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "亚利沙，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "70aa2023c43fcbd3e0f37bfa70165c4535763c65efebe7602085a97d76139d7e", "ja": "亜利沙、ダンスレッスン中にへたり込んで、\nしばらく動けなくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "亚利沙在舞蹈训练中突然瘫坐下来，一时动不了了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "99a5a561f1518eb08b9ad38275ebd88102e6de49e3b785794e427d9518954e01", "ja": "どうやら貧血だったみたいです。\n少し休めば、大丈夫だとは思いますけど……。", "zh": "看来好像是贫血。\n稍微休息一下，应该就没事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c0b96fe5734ea15cabdb4adc2968f19527dfc8e9535a3bc2b6bf4b8f3be88e0d", "ja": "そうだったのか……大事がなくてよかった。\nみんな、ありがとう。", "zh": "原来是这样……没出什么大事，真是太好了。\n谢谢大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "78b13b8cd6b47537589dc29aea54c8ad2044601a1c7ef8706f4210296d9ef660", "ja": "念のため、亜利沙の今日のレッスンは休みにしよう。\nみんな、それで大丈夫だよな？", "zh": "为了保险起见，亚利沙今天的课程就暂停吧。\n大家这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "7d34c23d8a6b601594cc35dfd37d5e1f35ec056582be8f65f30d77607385576f", "ja": "だ、ダメですよぉ！　ありさもやります！\nちょっと寝不足なだけですから……！", "zh": "不、不行呀！　亚利沙也要做！\n只是有点睡眠不足而已……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "8c006a38e3a6ad185c698258c71cc6b098a50ea3850a3e23240f6223b50b539b", "ja": "寝不足？", "zh": "睡眠不足？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142", "ja": "あっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "025432066d87c500c251e80143963a4ad9be04d65fa0479b16f91b327445320a", "ja": "亜利沙……寝不足ってどういう事だ？\n学校も、今は試験期間とかじゃないよな？", "zh": "亚利沙……睡眠不足是怎么回事？\n学校现在也不是考试期间吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "c136eff58f2755467bc94fe8fe1b41a5bdccdd465b64cd08fbcd864eff6dad8c", "ja": "えっと、その……撮りためた映像の編集をしてたら、\n寝るのがすっかり遅くなっちゃいまして……。", "zh": "那个……我一直在剪辑之前拍下的影像，不知不觉就睡晚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "42b2c7c002c5f73e866c4b65df5f82754a7944a3853ce32a7aa48cca82e59282", "ja": "ありゃあ……よくないよぉ、亜利沙さん。お日様の下で\nしっかり体を動かすには、夜はちゃんと寝ないと。", "zh": "哎呀呀……这样可不行哦，亚利沙。要是想在太阳底下\n好好活动身体，晚上就得好好睡觉才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "4d349d2bd6c74f4ad1fc6edef78ac48760739c0e7f0174ead95ed74607a066a7", "ja": "お昼に食欲なかったのも、もしかしてそのせいかな？\nちゃんと食べて、ちゃんと休まなきゃ。", "zh": "中午没什么食欲，难道也是因为这个吗？\n得好好吃饭，也得好好休息才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "2e10aae3b9475324d70ad737d349ae3ba1d89b3f9befc7da67c9cca897707034", "ja": "はい……。あ、でも本当に、ちょっと休憩すれば\n大丈夫ですから！　だから、今日のレッスン……。", "zh": "是……啊，不过真的，只要稍微休息一下\n就没事了！所以，今天的课程……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "6b82ee04485e0c326504dd14eef265b10a87e5f5933735287209dc70b0408aac", "ja": "はぁ……仕方ないわね。{$P$}、\n後、お願いしてもいいですか？", "zh": "唉……真拿你没办法。{$P$}，接下来就拜托你了，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "84273b8d3c3de5de667fc9624350d499da1a1ec8621cd64d3bb4e947409f157c", "ja": "わかった。……亜利沙、今日はやっぱりオフに変更だ。\n車で送っていくから、準備をしよう。", "zh": "知道了。……亚利沙，今天还是改成休息吧。\n我开车送你回去，准备一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "56d132cbb94a30714c91b3f7f8d484197e3b2481380b828b51885804d0073bcb", "ja": "うぅ……わ、わかりました……。", "zh": "呜呜……我、我知道了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "98203f725b65261ce9da1dd80782cbd34b212a2812558aa6c3e42b57870c31bd", "ja": "よし、着替えてきたな。\n忘れ物はないか？", "zh": "好，已经换好衣服了。  \n有没有忘带什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "23dea65e4dde7a693a5f49709a409196ab147844274b640fbfe33a191e47a7ba", "ja": "はい……。あの……{$P$}さん。\nありさがいなくて、特典撮影はどうするんですか？", "zh": "嗯……那个……{$P$}先生。没有亚利沙，特典拍摄要怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "9c068d79f03e8fd3b54d1b86a84bdac51362d94bade9ed5ddb38722b8bd6e936", "ja": "今日のところは、俺がやっておくよ。\n亜利沙の腕前には及ばないだろうけどな。", "zh": "今天就由我来负责吧。\n虽然肯定比不上亚利沙的本事就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0ee7b948090d24c9286a3210979c6f053c9059c79351b73fa132993081993712", "ja": "さて、それじゃあ準備も整ったことだし、\n家まで送ろう。駐車場の方に……。", "zh": "那么，既然都准备好了，\n我送你回家吧。先去停车场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "1524ff4478ded6f02372e6335944644f64d5b3b537078503afead33399f5dd50", "ja": "……あ！　ありさ、更衣室に\nポケットティッシュを忘れてきちゃったカモ！", "zh": "……啊！亚利沙好像把\n便携纸巾忘在更衣室了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ac0ae302b229b76def1feff1ad31a14b97edb61b07f15aca9ef10a701aafe891", "ja": "ポケットティッシュ？　更衣室まで戻るのも\n手間だろう。ここに新品があるよ、ほら。", "zh": "纸巾？再回更衣室也挺麻烦的吧。这里有新的，给。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "85ca258604f22ed77809095f7021af5d1c767543db7c406e1b64796cf953b5e5", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。えっと……あっ！\n飲み物！　の、飲み物買ってきてもいいですか？", "zh": "谢、谢谢您……那个……啊！\n饮料！我、我可以去买点饮料回来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9ab98e4886fbd130fcd7913061a58f14bfc93567ac80c39eeae27a1bfb1a0333", "ja": "亜利沙……劇場に残りたいからって時間稼ぎをするな。\n今日は休みなんだから、帰っておとなしく寝る事。", "zh": "亚利沙……别因为想留在剧场，就故意拖延时间。\n今天是休息日，回去老老实实睡觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "cd93d07b447af17d13e7c6c0407899d923ce180d23e113c874e454e648731c28", "ja": "うっ、さすが{$P$}さん……\n恐ろしい洞察力ですぅ……！", "zh": "呜，真不愧是{$P$}先生……\n洞察力太可怕啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "613d3a4a0f9528df98ea6575559fd6a20a997e41fe08b96034281736abc75684", "ja": "体調不良で、1日レッスンを休むだけだろ。\n何をそんなに心配してるんだ？", "zh": "只是因为身体不适，休息1天课程而已吧。你在担心什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "196d404d1c388feee86e86e2a6227b9958f9495ef530c2b91c453279a19a977b", "ja": "それは……そうなんですケド……ありさの勝手で、\nみんなに、すごく迷惑をかけてしまったので……。", "zh": "那……虽然是这样没错……可是因为是有纱擅自做主，给大家添了很大的麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "f0ec61df7b19ab4b8816882ae242237055ef00b176a322daa433e35ce1f5a959", "ja": "みんな、お、怒ってるんじゃないかなって……。", "zh": "大家会不会在生、生气呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "a5b585db86f9ad57a02a10365ad29261d1d5449b41ed4b2a26a1423eb029c9e3", "ja": "亜利沙……。", "zh": "亚利沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "e437c8d2a231ccc436c2d0daba9d2caa4cc4f779d278cf070ba02409c2884342", "ja": "絶対、そうだと思うんです！　だっていつもなら、\n律子さんにすっごく怒られると思うんですケド！", "zh": "我绝对觉得就是这样！毕竟平时的话，律子小姐肯定会狠狠训我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "e43e3842346ecae1a7026179f3eafcea32987f6a04d3ec88086aa3ecfca99d51", "ja": "律子さん、何も言いませんでした……\nもしかして、呆れちゃったんでしょうか？", "zh": "律子小姐什么都没说……\n难道说，是对我感到无语了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "7aa99c4e4e36712b68b657ac5244cecc7c05fb9ceea8ce63889ffc3c82d6c965", "ja": "ありさ、嫌われちゃったのカモ……。", "zh": "亚利沙可能……被讨厌了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "71e19b0b96e7d42c2f25291635b6b6a08b939df043caf976b2258ed4ea39735d", "ja": "このくらいで、律子が亜利沙を嫌うなんて事、\nあるわけがないだろ。", "zh": "就这点小事，律子怎么可能会讨厌亚利沙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "ccbd67418cd23ea20ec9597baa4ec665c835ba367734f38481aeac704236b74f", "ja": "律子が何も言わなかったのは、ホッとしたからだよ。\nそれくらい、亜利沙の事を心配してたんだ。", "zh": "律子之所以什么都没说，是因为松了一口气啊。\n她就是有那么担心亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1041_028ari", "source_sha256": "e9f47b6061bbfb3843402371df86442f8ad4046900cd1949face4d38213b5aff", "ja": "えっ……あ。", "zh": "诶……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "734414b8676df03a46475e08bbb2b761e067d840931ae695887119e0c5eb5eda", "ja": "亜利沙が……まあ半分は趣味だろうけど、特典撮影の\nために頑張ってるのは、みんなもわかってるよ。", "zh": "大家都知道，亚利沙……虽然一半应该是因为兴趣，但她确实在为了特典拍摄努力着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "decc72b7fcbe0f834b2c0ce37db261177949f46dc2521202f4fe59fc3ae0460b", "ja": "だからこそ、あまり心配をかけちゃダメだ。\nなら、亜利沙が今やるべき事……わかるよな？", "zh": "正因为如此，不能让大家太担心。那，亚利沙现在该做的事……明白了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "065b4d94d77d493ab0396953d35f7e86e5825f90ef18757b40f5e5e5676828a3", "ja": "そうですね……ありさが、間違ってました。\nごめんなさい、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "是啊……是有纱做错了。\n对不起，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "16817f125aa74b55e7d60aeb7405407110597270cd08e7143991bf09ec50b76a", "ja": "わかってくれたならいいんだ。\nまずはしっかり休んで、万全を期す事にしよう。", "zh": "你能明白就好。\n先好好休息，做好万全准备吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1046_028ari", "source_sha256": "bfa0e309d9fc149637bab6d8352639046ecb9bc1e53d2561cb349f0a647fe16c", "ja": "わかりました……！\nありさ、ばっちり体調を整えて戻ってきます！", "zh": "我知道了……！\n亚利沙一定会好好调理好身体回来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1047_028ari", "source_sha256": "7357585df6c379aa071dcaa5badc996ad805489c0f69299708bb11d6c1af17d5", "ja": "だからその間、アイドルちゃんの撮影は\n{$P$}さんにおまかせしますね！", "zh": "所以这段时间，偶像们的拍摄就拜托给{$P$}先生啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "e315250414fa53695d340bb5b7694107660dec4f7bb7c7c78449238d8f4f74a3", "ja": "（そう言った亜利沙は、少し涙を滲ませているようにも\n見えた。……今は何も心配せず、休んでもらおう）", "zh": "（说完这句话的亚利沙，眼中似乎也泛起了些许泪光。……现在就什么都别担心，好好休息吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
